=== dequant-then-cuBLAS (real pack.hpp encodings) ===
device NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 6GB Laptop GPU  denominator 124.2 GB/s  shape 256x256 max_M 8  fmt all
  dequant check int4_g128  n=65536  max_abs=0  max_rel=0
custom  int4_g128  N=256 K=256  packed 0.03 MB  W_fp16 0.12 MB  rot 24
  M=1  cold=8.58 us  %ideal(fp16)=12.4  %ideal(packed)=3.3
  M=2  cold=10.24 us  %ideal(fp16)=10.5  %ideal(packed)=2.8
  M=4  cold=10.24 us  %ideal(fp16)=10.6  %ideal(packed)=3.0
  M=8  cold=10.28 us  %ideal(fp16)=10.9  %ideal(packed)=3.3
  dequant check mxfp4  n=65536  max_abs=0  max_rel=0
custom  mxfp4  N=256 K=256  packed 0.03 MB  W_fp16 0.12 MB  rot 24
  M=1  cold=15.57 us  %ideal(fp16)=6.8  %ideal(packed)=1.9
  M=2  cold=18.26 us  %ideal(fp16)=5.9  %ideal(packed)=1.6
  M=4  cold=18.30 us  %ideal(fp16)=5.9  %ideal(packed)=1.7
  M=8  cold=18.35 us  %ideal(fp16)=6.1  %ideal(packed)=1.9

Sanity floor (real encodings). Extra dequant write + FP16 re-read vs a fused path.
